{"expand":"renderedFields,names,schema,operations,editmeta,changelog,versionedRepresentations","id":"57891","self":"https://shopview.atlassian.net/rest/api/2/issue/57891","key":"SV-11397","fields":{"summary":"Tech View – Avatars Stay the Same Size at Compact, Regular and Comfortable","parent":{"id":"56393","key":"SV-10049","self":"https://shopview.atlassian.net/rest/api/2/issue/56393","fields":{"summary":"Density in Tech View and Board View","status":{"self":"https://shopview.atlassian.net/rest/api/2/status/10350","description":"","iconUrl":"https://shopview.atlassian.net/","name":"Ready for QA","id":"10350","statusCategory":{"self":"https://shopview.atlassian.net/rest/api/2/statuscategory/4","id":4,"key":"indeterminate","colorName":"yellow","name":"In Progress"}},"priority":{"self":"https://shopview.atlassian.net/rest/api/2/priority/3","iconUrl":"https://shopview.atlassian.net/images/icons/priorities/medium_new.svg","name":"Medium","id":"3"},"issuetype":{"self":"https://shopview.atlassian.net/rest/api/2/issuetype/10245","id":"10245","description":"Stories track functionality or features expressed as user goals.","iconUrl":"https://shopview.atlassian.net/rest/api/2/universal_avatar/view/type/issuetype/avatar/10315?size=medium","name":"Story","subtask":false,"avatarId":10315,"entityId":"2d932db9-30a4-451f-aa74-561885726568","hierarchyLevel":0}}},"attachment":[{"self":"https://shopview.atlassian.net/rest/api/2/attachment/62401","id":"62401","filename":"D-DESIGN-7-b-densities.png","author":{"self":"https://shopview.atlassian.net/rest/api/2/user?accountId=712020%3A6d590212-5c9b-4135-ae11-277f3826110e","accountId":"712020:6d590212-5c9b-4135-ae11-277f3826110e","emailAddress":"bilal.muzamil@shopview.com","avatarUrls":{"48x48":"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/939e0aa31ab923104bfaac4c5012d8c0?d=https%3A%2F%2Favatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net%2Finitials%2FBM-2.png","24x24":"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/939e0aa31ab923104bfaac4c5012d8c0?d=https%3A%2F%2Favatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net%2Finitials%2FBM-2.png","16x16":"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/939e0aa31ab923104bfaac4c5012d8c0?d=https%3A%2F%2Favatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net%2Finitials%2FBM-2.png","32x32":"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/939e0aa31ab923104bfaac4c5012d8c0?d=https%3A%2F%2Favatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net%2Finitials%2FBM-2.png"},"displayName":"Bilal Muzamil","active":true,"timeZone":"Asia/Karachi","accountType":"atlassian"},"created":"2026-10-15T08:06:39.235-0500","size":239009,"mimeType":"image/png","content":"https://shopview.atlassian.net/rest/api/2/attachment/content/62401","thumbnail":"https://shopview.atlassian.net/rest/api/2/attachment/thumbnail/62401"}],"description":"h2. Description\n\nWhen the density changes, *the avatars in Tech View should get smaller at Compact and larger at Comfortable*, as the rows do.\n\nFor example,\n\n* the rows change height between Compact, Regular and Comfortable\n* the technician avatars on the rows and group headers stay the same size at all three\n\nh2. Steps to Reproduce\n\n# Open *Work Orders*, click the *All* tab and click *Tech View* in the display switcher.\n# Click the density button and choose *Compact*, then *Regular*, then *Comfortable*, looking at the avatars each time.\n#* The rows get taller from Compact to Comfortable.\n#* The avatars are the same size at all three densities.\n\n*Actual Result:*\n\n* The avatars do not change size with the density.\n\n*Expected Result:*\n\n* Compact: the avatars are smaller; Comfortable: the avatars are larger (the test's own words below).\n\n!D-DESIGN-7-b-densities.png|width=1642,height=864!\n\nh2. Environment\n\n* *Build:* {{v26.40.17-a5c4210}} on [staging|https://app.staging.shopview.com/workorders] · *Location:* Staging Heavy Duty - 9919 · seen 15 Oct 2026\n\nh2. Sources\n\n* Test case C590128 (Expected, verbatim):\nStep 3: the rows are at their lowest (36 px in the design), the avatars are smaller and the progress bars shorter and thinner (48 × 4 px in the design), as in the Compact picture.\nStep 7: the rows are the tallest (64 px in the design) and the avatars larger, as in the Comfortable picture.\n* [PRD – Work Orders — Board View & Tech View Display Options|https://shopview.atlassian.net/wiki/pages/viewpage.action?pageId=845185030] (page 845185030, version 52, 14 Oct 2026, as quoted by the test case), S6-R2:\nDensity adjusts spacing and the size of rows, cards, and their elements.\n* Design reference — Claude Design project \"Work Orders\" (Branko Cicovic), export of 14 Oct 2026, Work Orders.dc.html, Tech View avatar size by density:\ncrewSize: rowDensity === \"large\" ? 32 : rowDensity === \"small\" ? 20 : 24\n\nh2. Test case\n\n* [C590128|https://shopview.testrail.io/index.php?/cases/view/590128]","issuelinks":[{"id":"33576","self":"https://shopview.atlassian.net/rest/api/2/issueLink/33576","type":{"id":"10003","name":"Relates","inward":"relates to","outward":"relates to","self":"https://shopview.atlassian.net/rest/api/2/issueLinkType/10003"},"outwardIssue":{"id":"56393","key":"SV-10049","self":"https://shopview.atlassian.net/rest/api/2/issue/56393","fields":{"summary":"Density in Tech View and Board View","status":{"self":"https://shopview.atlassian.net/rest/api/2/status/10350","description":"","iconUrl":"https://shopview.atlassian.net/","name":"Ready for QA","id":"10350","statusCategory":{"self":"https://shopview.atlassian.net/rest/api/2/statuscategory/4","id":4,"key":"indeterminate","colorName":"yellow","name":"In Progress"}},"priority":{"self":"https://shopview.atlassian.net/rest/api/2/priority/3","iconUrl":"https://shopview.atlassian.net/images/icons/priorities/medium_new.svg","name":"Medium","id":"3"},"issuetype":{"self":"https://shopview.atlassian.net/rest/api/2/issuetype/10245","id":"10245","description":"Stories track functionality or features expressed as user goals.","iconUrl":"https://shopview.a